    <item>
      <title>With Jensen Huang’s Return as C.E.O., Trump Effectively Overrode Nvidia’s Board</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/technology/jensen-huang-nvidia-board-trump.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/technology/jensen-huang-nvidia-board-trump.html</guid>
      <atom:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/technology/jensen-huang-nvidia-board-trump.html" rel="standout"></atom:link>
      <description>Nvidia’s board said Mr. Huang would not be back. But President Trump, who pushed for Mr. Huang’s reinstatement, effectively overrode the board, governance experts said.</description>
